stage_b_reviewed_content.statement:
Let $S$ be a locally Noetherian scheme.
The following are equivalent:
\begin{enumerate}
\item $S$ is universally catenary, and
\item all local rings $\mathcal{O}_{S, s}$ of $S$ are universally catenary.
\end{enumerate}

